            },
            {
                Name: "OC Bobby",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>
    
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Haha, nice job pulling that monster weed. But maybe try to keep your footing when you pull.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:Pink">reaching down and adjusting his bulge,</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You nearly headbutt my junk there.”</span> He just laughs it off, but you can’t get the sweaty, musky scent of his groin out of your nose as you go back to work, avoiding eye contact with him until you’ve finished. <br>
    <<socialChange "Bobby" 3 1>>
