<<else>>
    He’s not wrong when he says those suckers are in there pretty deep. You try your hardest but find yourself drenched with sweat after only a few minutes and it looks like you’ve hardly made a dent. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> looks a little tired as well, but nowhere near as much as you do. Soon, you have no choice but to collapse onto the ground to take a second to catch your breath. <span style="color:LightGreen">Despite feeling like you didn’t do that much, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> seems very thankful for your help once he calls it a day.</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Weeding is a never-ending job around here.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You helped a bunch, really. I appreciate it!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">His words make you smile, glad to have helped, even in a small way.</span> <br>
    <<socialChange "Bobby" 3 1>>
    <<skillPoints "Athletics" 3>>
